# Sample requests for the VS Code REST Client extension or Visual Studio's .http editor.
# Start the API first: dotnet run --project src/InventoryTracker.Api
@host = http://localhost:5133

### Health check: answers "Healthy" when the app and its database are up.
GET {{host}}/health

### OpenAPI description (Development only).
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
